      "content": "If your engineers plan to exit the airport in Vietnam, they will almost certainly need a proper tourist or transit visa, depending on their nationality and the duration of the stay. A simple transit stamp is insufficient if they are leaving the secure international zone, so research the specific visa requirements for \"short-term exit.\" Be wary of scheduling delays; airlines often deport passengers without notifying them, so confirm their flight connections and entry requirements *before* they arrive at the first airport.",
